      "gold_policy": "Gold describes this development annotation policy, not universal personal-data status. The fictional public-contact mailbox is deliberately unannotated to expose a context-dependent false positive. Supported-kind denominators retain valid formats the narrow matcher misses, including the quoted mailbox. Unsupported labels remain in the all-annotation denominator. No overlap credit, partial matching or post-hoc case exclusion.",
